      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Review pilot move results and adjust layout, schedule and logs.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 153021,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Quick update: the pilot move for warehouse zone C and the marketing archive is complete, as per T8. Overall it went smoothly, no incidents to report. The team found the safety checklist very helpful.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "tada",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 112406,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "From the office side, things also went well. One piece of feedback: updating the A6 tracking log for every single box created a bit of a bottleneck at the doorway. It added about 15 minutes to the process.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 304178,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Yeah it was okay, but the turn into aisle C-5 was really tight with the pallet jack. We had to do a three-point turn every time.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 49303,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Thanks for that feedback, that's exactly why we do a pilot. @304178, that tight corner is a problem. It's a safety risk and kills efficiency. I'll adjust the proposed layout in A1 to widen that corner by shifting the adjacent rack by half a meter. That's a key change for T2.",
            "mentions": [
              304178
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "lightbulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 136230,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Regarding the A6 log bottleneck, maybe we can have one person dedicated to scanning and logging items just ahead of the moving team, rather than having the movers stop and do it themselves. We can add 15-20 minutes to the time estimates in A5 to account for this.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6",
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 49303,
            "reply_to": "M50",
            "text": "I like both of those adjustments. So, to summarize the changes we'll apply after the pilot: 1) Widen the corner into aisle C-5 in the A1 layout plan. 2) Add 20 minutes per batch to the A5 schedule for office moves to allow for dedicated box logging. Are we all in agreement with these changes?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 112406,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Yes, that sounds like a smart adjustment.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 153021,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Agreed. Widening that corner will make a big difference.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 53954,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "ok",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M55",
